  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Hyper-Mach BD is an advanced dual-poly hybrid developed with Brain Dead, combining smooth Hyper-G Round with shaped Mach-10. The configuration can be reversed to tune performance: Hyper-G Round in the mains produces a deeper, more penetrating ball, while Hyper-G Round in the crosses places Mach-10 in the mains for greater spin and heavier ball production. The 1.20 mm hybrid system is engineered by Solinco and designed by Brain Dead.",

    "zh": "Solinco Hyper-Mach BD 是 Solinco 与 Brain Dead 合作推出的高性能双聚酯 Hybrid 系统，将圆形 Hyper-G Round 与异形 Mach-10 组合在一起。通过改变主横线方向可以调整整体性能：Hyper-G Round 做主线时，更强调深度和穿透力；Hyper-G Round 做横线、Mach-10 做主线时，则更强调旋转和更重的球质。该系统采用 1.20 毫米规格，由 Solinco 负责性能工程，Brain Dead 负责设计。"
  },

